ble-native — Rust-native CH582/583 BLE link layer
================================================

This crate contains an independent Rust implementation of the CH582/583
baseband / link-layer-engine / RF initialisation, calibration and TX/RX
primitives. The register addresses, bit-field layouts and the three-point
TX/RX calibration procedure are factual data taken from the MIT-licensed
ch32fun project:

    ch32fun — examples_ch5xx/iSLER, extralibs/iSLER.h
    Copyright (c) 2023-2024 CNLohr <lohr85@gmail.com>, et al.
    MIT License
    https://github.com/cnlohr/ch32fun

The full ch32fun license text, including the WCH copyright line that covers
its WCH-derived hardware definitions, is reproduced in LICENSE-ch32fun.

No WCH LIBCH58xBLE.a object, EVT application source, or decompiled output is
linked, copied or translated by this crate. The protocol logic (PDU layout,
scanning, parsing) is written against the Bluetooth Core Specification.
